---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Solar Panel Installation Thailand | Residential & Commercial | JJ Com Solar Cell';
const description = 'Professional solar panel installation across Thailand. Rooftop and ground-mount systems for homes and businesses. 10+ years experience, free quote.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-solar-green">Home</a> / <span>Services</span> / <span>Solar Panel Installation</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-solar-yellow/20 text-solar-yellow px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-6">
        Serving Thailand Since 2016
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Solar Panel Installation</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Complete rooftop and ground-mount solar panel systems for residential and commercial properties across Thailand.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Residential Installation</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Custom system design based on your roof and electricity usage</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Panel placement optimized for maximum sun exposure</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Inverter and battery integration</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Net metering registration with MEA/PEA</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Commercial Installation</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Large-scale rooftop and carport installations</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Power purchase agreement (PPA) structuring</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Corporate sustainability reporting</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-solar-green shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Ongoing maintenance contracts</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Installation Process</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-solar-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Site Survey</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Free on-site assessment of roof, shading, and electrical system</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-solar-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">System Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Custom panel layout and inverter specification</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-solar-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Installation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Professional installation by certified technicians</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-solar-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Commissioning</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Testing, grid connection, and monitoring setup</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">How long does installation take?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Most residential installations take 1–3 days. Commercial projects vary by size.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Do I need a new roof?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Not necessarily. We assess roof condition during the site survey. Most existing roofs can support solar panels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Will installation damage my roof?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">No. We use industry-standard mounting systems with proper sealing. All penetrations are weatherproofed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-blue-50 rounded-xl p-8 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Resources</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/guides/solar-sunlight-hours" class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="font-bold">Sunlight Hours in Thailand</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Discover which months are best for solar generation</div>
        </a>
        <a href="/guides/solar-system-sizing" class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="font-bold">System Sizing Calculator</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Calculate the right system size for your home</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="bg-solar-green text-white rounded-xl p-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Ready to Go Solar?</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">Get a free site survey and quote for your solar panel installation.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="inline-block bg-white text-solar-green font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">
        Get a Free Quote
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 opacity-80">
        Based in <a href="/" class="underline">Koh Chang</a>, serving all of Thailand.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
